{
  "name": "qingzhan-lead-chat",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "轻站线索客服 SaaS - 一段 JS 嵌入，客服 + 访客行为埋点 + 营销触达 + 轻线索 CRM 一体化",
  "main": "server/index.js",
  "scripts": {
